{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35850","headline":"送黄宾于赴举 · 李咸用","name":"送黄宾于赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风昨夜满潇湘，衰柳残蝉思客肠。\n早是乱来无胜事，更堪江上揖离觞。\n澄潭跃鲤摇轻浪，落日飞凫趁远樯。\n渔父不须探去意，一枝春褭月中央。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}